  <developer id="io.github.samyyy2311">
    <name>CassetteCat contributors</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>CassetteCat is a local-first desktop music player for music you already own.</p>
    <p>It organises your music folder by songs, artists, albums, and folders, and plays it with a queue that survives restarts, ReplayGain, a sleep timer, and a floating mini player.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Synced lyrics from your files or LRCLIB, with timing adjustment</li>
      <li>A Listening Record with your history, top songs and artists, and a yearly and monthly Rewind</li>
      <li>Scrobbling to Libre.fm and ListenBrainz, and an optional Discord status</li>
      <li>Internet radio, and optional Jellyfin and Subsonic servers</li>
      <li>Full keyboard control, global shortcuts, and MPRIS media controls</li>
      <li>Offline Blackout Mode, which stops every online lookup</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.samyyy2311.CassetteCat.desktop</launchable>
